+The `stats` command gives a quick overall summary — total count, total spent, average
+per expense, and the date range the data covers:
+
+```bash
+python -m tally.cli stats
+```
+
+The `export` command writes everything out as CSV so you can open it in a spreadsheet:
+
+```bash
 python -m tally.cli export --out march.csv
+python -m tally.cli export          # prints to stdout
+```
