+## Checking budgets
+
+Monthly budgets are defined per category in `tally/config.py`. The `budget` command
+shows how much you have spent against each one and flags categories where you have
+used 80% or more of the limit:
+
+```bash
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
 ```
 
